Retrieve Employees with Salary Greater Than 40,000
Problem Statement

Write an SQL query to display the Name and Department of employees whose salary is greater than 40,000.
Explanation
SELECT Name, Department → Retrieves only the Name and Department columns.
FROM Employees → Specifies the Employees table.
WHERE Salary > 40000 → Filters employees whose salary is greater than 40,000.
Example Input
EmployeeID	Name	Department	Salary
1	Amit	HR	35000
2	Priya	IT	50000
3	Rahul	Sales	42000
4	Neha	IT	60000
Expected Output
Name	Department
Priya	IT
Rahul	Sales
Neha	IT
